 | caption2 = Tagore's Bengali-language initials, the letters র and ঠ, are worked into this "Ro-Tho" (of RAbindranath THAkur) wooden seal, stylistically similar to designs used in traditional [[Haida argillite carvings|Haida carvings]] from the [[Pacific Northwest]] region of North America. Tagore often embellished his manuscripts with such art.{{Sfn|Dyson|2001}}
